msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-hash-path.md:41
msgid ""
"`nar` (the default): Serialises the input as a [Nix Archive](../../store/"
"file-system-object/content-address.md#serial-nix-archive) and passes that to "
"the hash function."
msgstr ""

#: source/command-ref/new-cli/nix3-hash-path.md:46
msgid ""
"`flat`: Assumes that the input is a single file and [directly passes](../../"
"store/file-system-object/content-address.md#serial-flat) it to the hash "
"function."
msgstr ""

